WEBVTT

00:16:28.396 --> 00:16:32.116
It was it was finally admitted
to the Oxford English Dictionary,

00:16:32.116 --> 00:16:34.996
despite having been around
for thousands of years,

00:16:35.036 --> 00:16:36.476
in the '70s.

00:16:36.476 --> 00:16:39.076
And then in 2014,
they relented a little bit more

00:16:39.076 --> 00:16:42.076
and they added “cunty,” “cuntish,”
“cunted” and “cunting.”

00:16:42.476 --> 00:16:45.116
So we all know exactly what that means.

00:16:47.676 --> 00:16:49.036
The Ofcom,

00:16:49.076 --> 00:16:52.196
the regulator for UK TV censorship

00:16:52.196 --> 00:16:54.476
in 2016 released a poll

00:16:54.516 --> 00:16:56.996
of what they regarded
to be the most offensive words

00:16:57.036 --> 00:16:58.756
and "cunt" was bang up there.

00:16:58.796 --> 00:17:00.156
It was on top.